{"publicId":"291deace-6281-428b-8f6c-0b38ce9d570c","title":"空中工业集团及AST SpaceMobile相继提交8-K文件披露不同信息","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T21:35:20.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-17T21:35:20.000Z","digest":"空中工业集团（2026-11-16）与AST SpaceMobile, Inc.（2026-11-18）均向SEC EDGAR提交8-K文件，前者披露了与监管调查（FD）相关的最新信息，后者仅更新了公司地址和联系方式且未提及重大事件。SEC尚未对调查进展作出公开回应。\n\n空中工业集团的8-K文件明确提到监管调查（FD），符合上市公司重大事件4日申报时限要求；AST SpaceMobile提交的8-K文件中未包含任何重大事件或财务信息，仅更新基础联络信息。两份文件均通过SEC EDGAR平台公开，但披露内容存在显著差异。\n\nSEC要求上市公司在知悉重大事件后4个工作日内提交8-K申报，但未对文件内容进行强制分类。空中工业集团的披露可能影响投资者决策，而AST SpaceMobile的申报则属于常规程序。目前SEC仅确认收到文件，未对具体调查展开说明。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-17T22:00:28.404Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"AST SpaceMobile, Inc. 提交 8-K 文件","latestReport":{"id":"koxzrtfof9ylyorkmz5ibekob"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"f7tMJPsUMLJs","title":"AST SpaceMobile, Inc. 提交 8-K 申报","firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T21:35:20.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"koxzrtfof9ylyorkmz5ibekob","title":"AST SpaceMobile, Inc. 提交 8-K 文件","summary":"AST SpaceMobile, Inc. 提交 8-K 文件，披露了公司地址和联系方式。文件中未提及任何重大事件或财务信息。","source":{"name":"SEC EDGAR 最新申报","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T21:35:20.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[{"id":"koxzrtfof9ylyorkmz5ibekob","title":"AST SpaceMobile, Inc. 提交 8-K 文件","summary":"AST SpaceMobile, Inc. 提交 8-K 文件，披露了公司地址和联系方式。文件中未提及任何重大事件或财务信息。","source":{"name":"SEC EDGAR 最新申报","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T21:35:20.000Z","selected":false}],"timeline":[{"id":"koxzrtfof9ylyorkmz5ibekob","title":"AST SpaceMobile, Inc. 提交 8-K 文件","summary":"AST SpaceMobile, Inc. 提交 8-K 文件，披露了公司地址和联系方式。文件中未提及任何重大事件或财务信息。","source":{"name":"SEC EDGAR 最新申报","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T21:35:20.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-16T20:00:00.000Z","heat":8.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-16T21:00:00.000Z","